                <mxCell id="14" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;* Phase current sensing is done via ADCs in triple injection mode triggered by CH4 of the timer which generates the PWM signals for the inverter (frequency 20kHz for PWM).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;* Magnetic encoder value (AS5600) is sampled via I2C in another loop at a fixed frequency.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;* Values are processed in main(), all modifications are made in critical sections for both encoder and current values.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;* Use SVPWM to generate required phase voltages (reference voltage vector) with a 20kHz frequency as stated before. The timer generates an interrupt with a periodicity of 50us at this frequency and starts the ADC phase current sampling (double or triple injected mode). Then it computes Clarke and Park transforms, SVPWM, PI and other computations, updates CCRs for each timer channels associated to the phases and repeats.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;* Use LUTs for math computation to offload time required.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="420" width="300" height="390" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="15" value="&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Correct FOC steps (one PWM period)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;marker:text-secondary&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ol]:whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;Timer interrupt fires&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;(usually at the beginning or the middle of the PWM period)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ol]:whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;Sample the motor currents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-secondary&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ol]:whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;ADC reads phase currents (normally two phases; the third is calculated as &lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;c&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mo&gt;−&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo&gt;−&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;  i_c = -i_a - i_b  &lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.8095em; vertical-align: -0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;msupsub&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-t vlist-t2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.1514em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 2.7em;&quot; class=&quot;pstrut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal mtight&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-s&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot; class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mrel&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot; class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.8095em; vertical-align: -0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;−&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;msupsub&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-t vlist-t2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.1514em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 2.7em;&quot; class=&quot;pstrut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal mtight&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-s&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-right: 0.2222em;&quot; class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mbin&quot;&gt;−&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-right: 0.2222em;&quot; class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.8095em; vertical-align: -0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;msupsub&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-t vlist-t2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.3361em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 2.7em;&quot; class=&quot;pstrut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal mtight&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-s&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ol]:whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Often also sample DC-bus voltage and (if available) rotor position/speed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;amp;&amp;gt;ol]:whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;Clarke transform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo separator=&quot;true&quot;&gt;,&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo separator=&quot;true&quot;&gt;,&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;c&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;  &lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;  &lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;mo&gt;→&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;  &lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;mtext&gt;  &lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;α&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;mo separator=&quot;true&quot;&gt;,&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;i&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mi&gt;β&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;  i_a, i_b, i_c \;\;\rightarrow\;\; i_\alpha, i_\beta  &lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.854em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;msupsub&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-t vlist-t2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.1514em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 2.7em;&quot; class=&quot;pstrut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal mtight&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-s&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;height: 0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mpunct&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-right: 0.1667em;&quot; class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span 